OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow street sealed off after
OL,4,Awoman found injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have sealed off a Glasgow street
OL,7,Fafter a woman was found injured on
OL,8,FMonday night.
OL,10,FThe 27-year-old was taken to hospital
OL,11,Fafter emergency services were called to
OL,12,FEynort Street in the city's Lambhill
OL,13,Farea at about 23:45.
OL,15,FThe street remained closed off as
OL,16,Fpolice, including forensics officers,
OL,17,Fcombed the scene.
OL,19,FThe Daily Record quoted neighbours on
OL,20,Fthe street as saying they had heard
OL,21,Fwhat sounded like a gunshot around the
OL,22,Ftime of the incident.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
